{"parse": {"title": "RGS-07", "pageid": 146432, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-06\" title=\"RGS-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RGS-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/RGS-08\" title=\"RGS-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RGS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A3.9E.E8.A1.8C.E4.BD.93.E9.AA.8C.E5.88.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"飞行体验券\">飞行体验券</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 飞行体验券</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">One-Way Trip</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>设<span class=\"color-value\"></span>计<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>融<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>够<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>典<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>必<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3910107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_9_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_9_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/Cg-3_9_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305430.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-305430.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305430.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305430.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-305430.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305430.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-305430.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305430.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>各位，各位箱内的朋友——能听见我说话吗？能看到我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>记者ONiON经过火山岛主人的特别允许，已奔赴至火山岛现场，为您带来水上运动会的特别独家报道！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>这是一次仅限箱中朋友观看的特殊节目，机会难得，现在我们可以看到水上无动力飞行器的比赛平台，以及……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>热情如火的火山岛现场观众！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>情绪昂扬的记者将话筒转向观众席，明黄色的头套在日光之下闪烁，显得格外鲜亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>总之，比赛即将开始，如果您和我一样好奇火山岛水上运动会的盛况——我是说，有谁会不好奇呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305403.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305403.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/25/HeadIconSmall-305403.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305403.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洋葱头：</div><div>请您如同期待世界末日一样期待接下来的发展吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场特殊的赛事转播，信号由于距离和某种神秘术对所在地的保护而受到轻微干扰，画面时不时闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>伙计们，在彻夜工作之后，我觉得我需要四份意式浓缩来振奋精神……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我本以为在这座古希腊作风的岛上找不出一颗咖啡豆，但我竟然找到了一个咖啡馆！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>更神奇的是，那个咖啡师告诉我，咖啡馆白天卖咖啡，每当夜幕降临的时候，它就会切换成酒吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这太酷了！难道这群希腊人拥有瞬间改变建筑的神秘术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>也许他们只是在太阳下山的时候将咖啡单换成酒单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>或者说，他们的咖啡机也能流淌出啤酒……那将会是我在近期看过的最有格调的发明之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>就像我们通宵完成的杰作……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>从大小来看，它确实是一个杰作……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>庞大的飞行器底部安着滑轮，被推至沙滩上，在过分灿烂的阳光之下，它庞大的身躯投下一整片阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助手站在阴影里，仰着头，好奇地用目光探究它，吐露出一句最客观的评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它……很轻？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根手指伸出来，轻轻推了推飞行器，使它自下往上地晃动了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">全自动充气摇滚海盗船！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>看到上面那几个气球人了吗？那是二十世纪最伟大的几个摇滚乐手！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>它还自带播放器，可以在我们飞至巅峰时播放此生最爱的音乐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>亲爱的船员们，首战的播放权必须紧握在本船长手里——你们没有意见吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我没有任何意见——应星锑船长要求，播放到哪位乐手的歌曲，对应的乐手气球人就会开始飘动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神采奕奕的研究员也加入解说之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-301010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>充气设计有效降低了它的自重，考虑到我方没有大力水手，下方的轮滑也可以在起步时助力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-301011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>海盗船两侧藏有滑翔翼来开启你们优雅的飞翔，它们弹出时也会产生一些戏剧性效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>介绍完毕～总之，维尔汀，我对这个飞行器的设计还算满意，希望它可以带你们走向胜利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>祝你们好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等等，不对——！什么叫祝我们好运？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你不打算和我们一起参加比赛吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来自拉普拉斯的研究员耸了耸肩膀，摊开了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你们需要的是一位“专业科研人员”，那他当然只负责“科研”的部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>况且，无论是多棒的飞行器，它最终的结局都是要落入水中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而我不想湿漉漉地回到我的办公室，只想在视野最佳的观众席上目睹它的比赛表现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员脸上挂着游刃有余的微笑，和盘托出他的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>落入水中……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>所有飞行器都要落水，那我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手发现了一个显而易见，却一直被忽略的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一转头，研究员已经不见了踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>维尔汀，这就是你们的飞行器吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一道爽快的声音响起，显得饶有趣味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哎？哎！快挡住……！这是二十世纪最伟大的海盗船，不可以提前泄露！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伟大的海盗连忙抓过自己身旁的两位船员，紧紧贴着海盗船的底部，试图遮挡住它庞大的身躯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>海盗……？哈哈哈哈，你大可放心，我在这里，并不会影响它的惊艳登场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>水上竞技期间，一切事情都受我们公正裁判的保障。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>而我来到这里，只是想问你们一件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>——你们就打算穿成这样，参加我的水上运动会吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫多涅的嘴角挂着戏谑的笑容，打量着穿戴整齐的各位参赛者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>殿下的意思是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>你们一定会落入水里，却一点也不考虑落水后的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>衣服被水浸透之后变得又湿又重，想游也游不动，说不定就这样沉进水底，再也浮不起来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>自说自话地要参加水上运动会，却连像样的衣服都不穿，在我看来，这就是缺乏礼仪的表现！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起手，打了一个潇洒的响指。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>啊……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_12\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_9_at_12.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_9_at_12.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_9_at_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你怎么做到的？！这太犯规了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315615.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315615.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-315615.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315615.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>任何犯规的举动都会被忒弥斯察觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315616.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315616.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-315616.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315616.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>况且，这算是我的慷慨相助，免得你们像一群落水的金毛羊，怎么哭都爬不上岸！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-655501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>感谢您……为我们考虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315621.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315621.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-315621.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315621.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不用谢！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_29_zone\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_29_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"516\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_29_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1256\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扬了扬手，转身离开了，留下焕然一新的海盗与船员们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>好吧，她说得也没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>落水的金毛羊……想想就令人绝望！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RGS-07"}}